          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observations by 3 witnesses of a silent, gray-silver half-sphere passing through the sky with \"tentacles\" below: likely observations of a Mylar balloon.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "9bd14b33e72a1c52338d9c8bdd1ddd48ae1562ecc5e3473e417c10d2a85c81c7"
